This module bundles schema documents published by the W3C. They are third-party
documents, redistributed verbatim, and they are NOT covered by the MIT licence
that applies to the rest of github.com/knroy/go-xml. That is why they live in a
module of their own: depending on them is a choice a user makes explicitly
rather than one inherited from the core library.

Bundled documents
-----------------

  schemas/xml.xsd
      The schema for the xml: namespace (xml:lang, xml:space, xml:base,
      xml:id).
      Source:    https://www.w3.org/2001/xml.xsd
      Namespace: http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace

  schemas/XMLSchema.xsd
      The XSD 1.1 schema for schemas.
      Namespace: http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema

